# Verification & release

- Every change needs appropriate tests
- Never claim VERIFIED without objective evidence (CI URL, SHA, tests, migration head)
- Never merge without independent Security Reviewer + Test/QA evidence
- Use reviewer agents: Planner → implementers → Migration Reviewer (if DDL) → Test Writer → Security Reviewer
- Escalate security, isolation, financial, compliance, integrity, or maintainability risks immediately
